      value: Meet The Passionate Minds Behind Saratan Animations Studio. Our Team
        Is A Diverse Group Of Creative Individuals Dedicated To Developing Educational
        And Entertaining Apps For Children. Our Current App, Lalafun - Mini Games
        For Kids, Inspires Young Minds Through Fun And Interactive Activities. Join
        Us On Our Journey Towards Creating Joyful Learning Experiences For Children
